    {
      "s": 250.51,
      "e": 254.75,
      "text": "I feel like it's very important to be able to keep up on our skill level and work together"
    },
    {
      "s": 254.75,
      "e": 261.51,
      "text": "because we always have people from the military side of it that can be deployed or coming back"
    },
    {
      "s": 261.51,
      "e": 264.39,
      "text": "from deployments in that respect."
    },
    {
      "s": 264.39,
      "e": 270.71,
      "text": "I'm coming back and having to kind of go back to a water type exercise where we have to come"
    },
    {
      "s": 270.71,
      "e": 274.87,
      "text": "back together and use a little bit different skill level."
    },
    {
      "s": 274.87,
      "e": 276.47,
      "text": "Is there anything else you'd like to ask for?"
    },
    {
      "s": 276.47,
      "e": 282.27,
      "text": "Great experience and I think it's a great asset to the state and the public that we serve."
    }
